   "id": "wylde-flowers-191747@major-2024-01-27",
   "gameId": "wylde-flowers-191747",
   "displayName": "UPDATE NEWS: Eury's Salon Update Coming January 31st!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-01-27T01:46:39.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Update news today, cozy coven! ✂️",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "For those of you who follow our social media, you will have seen some hints about our new update (and asking when it will drop) ! 👀 Hair customisation has been something many fans have been asking for - so in this update, we have made it happen! 🥰",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our next update, Eury's Salon, will be coming to all platforms very soon, on January 31st! 🎉",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "In this FREE update, you can",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "✂️ Visit Fairhaven’s new hairdressing salon",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "💕 Meet a new romanceable character",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎨 Customise Tara's hair",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Eury's Salon Teaser Trailer",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Looking forward to seeing what you all think!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
