  {
   "id": "wylde-flowers-191747@1.5.2",
   "gameId": "wylde-flowers-191747",
   "displayName": "Update 1.5.2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-05-26T00:06:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello, hello cozy coven! 👋🔮",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve released a small patch that squashes a few pesky bugs and introduces some quality of life updates based on community feedback! 🐛 We’ve also tweaked the requirements for certain quests which were causing them to be easily missed. ✨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Full patch notes below! ⬇",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🌸 1.5.2 Update Notes🌸",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Released: May 25, 2023",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Animal Growth Booster and Mistletoe can now be purchased in year 2 without having completed \"A Fab-Yule-Ous Winter Ritual\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"A Fab-Yule-Ous Winter Ritual\" can be completed in any Winter in year 2 or later, instead of only during the second winter feast.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Good Duck With That\" and \"Fountain Of Youths\" quests can now start in any season, instead of limited to Fall and Winter, respectively.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated descriptions of magical animal items to make it clearer which type of animal produces them (English only).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've tweaked the default selection of crafting and cooking ingredients to work better when using up the last of your ingredients.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now craft build multiple crystal balls and writing desks for your sanctum.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Feedy will stop work if unable to feed a pregnant animal.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed animal gifting button not working when the language is set to Turkish.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a crash when pressing the \"Share Photo\" button on iPad.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed ducks and chickens sometimes stuck not animating.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy playing!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
